# Here are the steps to getting the required Gemini API key. Please do this before viewing the project locally

# Step 1: Login to your account here: https://aistudio.google.com/projects
# Step 2: Create a project
# Step 3: Go to API's Keys section
# Step 4: Click on the "Copy API key" button (looks like the copy icon)
# Step 5: Create an .env file with the same content as this one and add the API key where it is <GEMINI_API_KEY>
#*Note: If you have any questions, feel free to ask in our Discord or create an Issue in the repo

VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY = <GEMINI_API_KEY>